papers were among the requests I heard from

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:58.740
you before.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:03.120
And of course, I am also longing for more
as I have quite a few questions that keep

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.480
me up at night.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:08.990
Is it possible for us to ever come up with
a superintelligent AI?

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.870
If yes, how?

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.510
What types of these AIs could exist?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.850
Should we be worried?

